[session-defaults-gap-drill-chain]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: .session_defaults :: [FANOUT] F6, [LOOP] L3/L5/L6/L7
@decision: gap/blocker/exhaustion detect triggers unified DRILL_GAP fan-out across FANOUT and LOOP planes
@changes:
  - F6 DRILL_GAP: on {blocker | scaffold-gap | catalog-exhaustion | milestone exit-criteria met}, fire N>=3 nexus drill seeds + BG scaffold for predicted next-layer unblocker in ONE message; divergent angles (minimal-surface / alt-path / next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation); never serialize, never ask
  - L3 BUDGET: F6 DRILL_GAP burst exempt from 5-agent cap (gap/exhaustion breakthrough counted as single unit)
  - L5 HEARTBEAT: new required fields G=drill-gaps-active, P=pivots-triggered
  - L6 CHAIN: on blocker-breakthrough or milestone-completion within tick, fire F6 DRILL_GAP for next layer in SAME tick (no ScheduleWakeup delay) — chain breakthroughs compress roadmap ETA
  - L7 EXHAUST_PIVOT: on tick start with empty TaskList + empty active milestones + empty blocker queue, DO NOT end loop — fire F6 DRILL_GAP with pivot angles (next-layer-predict / adjacent-speculation / roadmap-unblock); exhaustion is transition signal, only explicit user halt (L4) terminates
@why: 2026-04-20 session observed CLM hxblas + stage0 chain-breakthroughs via ad-hoc drill fan-out (#27 r5-a6 BLAS 88-site swap → 3.5x speedup; #32 stage0 5min rebuild → TRAINER spawn). User confirmed pattern ("gap 있을 때 돌파하는데 좋더라구") and requested codification for both ad-hoc use and /loop continuity ("고갈시까지 ... 다음단계로 나갈수도 있어야"). Prior prompt lacked: (a) drill-fanout as first-class primitive, (b) exhaustion-as-pivot semantics in loop, (c) breakthrough chaining within a single tick.
@effect:
  - any gap/blocker/exhaustion event → immediate N-way divergent drill + preemptive next-layer scaffold, parallel, no approval gate
  - /loop never self-terminates on empty queue — it pivots via drill to discover next-layer work
  - breakthroughs compound within a tick instead of waiting one wakeup interval per layer
  - heartbeat exposes drill-gap and pivot counters, forcing visibility of the pattern in telemetry
@file: .session_defaults:18-22,37
@rollback: revert this commit; F6 removal also nullifies L3-exception and L6/L7 semantics (they reference F6)

[claudx-loop-infinite-wait-fix]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: bin/claudx-loop :: restart-on-exit circuit breaker
@bug: 새 `cl` 세션이 thinking/process 표시 없이 silent 무한대기 (user: "새세션에서 thinking 등 과정없이 무한대기 버그 조사 · 무결점 0 까지 개선").
@cause-chain:
  - A. rc!=0 + dur<3s 연속 실패 (e.g. `claude -c` → "No deferred tool marker" · "Not logged in" · "Error: Input must be provided with --print") 를 claudx-loop 가 일시 crash 로 판단해 영구 재시작.
  - B. rc=0 + dur<10s (--help · --version · 빠른 /quit) 도 clean-break 미적용, burst-cap 300s cooldown 후 재시작.
  - C. TUI 는 stderr 를 안 봄 (rc.log 로만) → 시각적 완전 silent = "thinking 없이 무한대기" 로 인지.
  - D. 35 고아 claudx-loop (ppid=1) 누적 — 터미널 종료 시 HUP 을 트랩만 하고 sleep 300s 완료까지 대기하는 설계로 self-terminate 지연 + cx_sessions 2893개 폭주.
@fix:
  - (B) rc=0 은 항상 clean_exit_break. dur>=10 조건 제거.
  - (A) rc!=0 && rc!=3 && dur<CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_DUR(def 3) 이 CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX(def 5) 회 연속이면 fastfail_break + stderr 에 rc.log 경로 안내.
  - (D) 고아 ppid=1 loop 35개 + 자식 sleep 전부 SIGKILL (live claude 자손 없는 것만). 향후는 A+B 로 self-reap.
@evidence-smoke:
  - `CLAUDX_NO_WATCH=1 claudx-loop --help` → rc=0 clean_exit_break 즉시 종료 (before: 무한).
  - `CLAUDX_NO_WATCH=1 CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX=3 claudx-loop --bogus` → 3회 fast-fail 후 "복구불가 상태로 판단, 종료" stderr + rc=0 (before: 무한).
  - orphan claudx-loop(ppid=1) post-reap = 0 (before: 35).
@file: bin/claudx-loop:34-40 / :74 / :123-133 / :137-152
@env-toggles:
  - CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_MAX — 연속 fast-fail cap (default 5)
  - CLAUDX_LOOP_FASTFAIL_DUR — fast-fail 간주 최대 dur 초 (default 3)
@zero-defect:
  - silent-hang 경로 = 0 (rc=0 any-dur → break; rc!=0 dur<3 x5 → break; rc=130 → break; rc=3 → exhausted-sleep 분기)
  - 고아 loop 누적 = 0 (기존 reap + 향후 self-reap)
@rollback: bin/claudx-loop 의 2026-04-20 패치 역적용 + 이전 `rc=0 && dur>=10` 조건 복원

[session-defaults-decide-section]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: .session_defaults :: [DECIDE] D1-D4 + [FANOUT] F6 angle extension
@decision: Formalize root-cause-first selection policy and anomaly-extraction as the auto-breakthrough primitive when choice is ambiguous.
@changes:
  - [DECIDE] D1 ROOT_CAUSE: root-cause resolution is the default; symptom patching requires TODO(root) and is allowed only when root inaccessible this turn.
  - [DECIDE] D2 PICK_RANK: strict selection order P0-blocker > anomaly/singularity > root-cause-layer > coldstart(F2) > longest-ETA(T1) > shallow-quick. No taste-based re-rank.
  - [DECIDE] D3 ANOMALY_DRILL: when no clear best or candidates rank-tied, fire F6 DRILL_GAP with seed "extract singularity from current state (logs, state-files, infra, roadmap, git, task queue, heartbeat history)". The drill's top singularity becomes the confirmed best choice and the auto-breakthrough target.
  - [DECIDE] D4 NO_SECOND_GUESS: once picked, execute. Re-pick only on {new P0 blocker | new D3 singularity | milestone exit-criteria met | explicit user override}.
  - [FANOUT] F6: added 'rank-tie (D3)' to trigger set and 'singularity-extract' to divergent-angle set. F6 now serves both gap/exhaustion and ambiguity-resolution roles.
@why: Observed pattern — when a /loop tick has multiple incomplete tasks, selection is frequently ambiguous and prior prompt had no codified rule. User explicitly requested root-cause-first policy ("근본원인 해결 강력 추천") and an auto-breakthrough mechanism via drill-based singularity extraction ("drill 해서 특이점 뽑거나 그럼 그게 최선의 선택"). Without D1-D4 the loop drifts to shallow symptom patches or burns cycles on re-ranking.
@effect:
  - Deterministic task selection at session boundaries and /loop ticks — no preference oscillation.
  - Ambiguity is no longer a stall — it becomes a drill trigger, and the drill output deterministically resolves the choice.
  - Root-cause fixes compound; symptom patches are surfaced as debt via TODO(root).
  - F6 becomes the unified mechanism for gap, exhaustion, breakthrough chaining, and ambiguity resolution.
@file: .session_defaults:39 (F6 extended), 60-65 (DECIDE section appended)
@rollback: revert this commit. D3 removal also breaks F6's rank-tie trigger; leave F6 angle-set untouched for the gap/exhaustion paths if only D1-D2-D4 need revert.

[session-defaults-chain-over-cron]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: .session_defaults :: [LOOP] L8 CHAIN_OVER_CRON
@decision: Codify completion-chain as the default pacing primitive for sequential long BG work; demote cron/fixed-interval to strictly-periodic no-state tasks.
@change: [LOOP] L8 added. For iter sweeps, queued probes, retry-after-fail chains: an agent/BG completion deterministically triggers the next spawn, instead of a wall-clock timer. Cron/CronCreate/ScheduleWakeup reserved for heartbeat, watchdog, daily rotate — tasks with no state-carry between firings.
@why: User empirically confirmed in 2026-04-20 session while running SWEEP P4 iter 70-147. First attempt used hourly cron at :17 — causes overlap if an iter takes >1h, idle gap if iters average <1h, and fires mid-work. User corrective ("매시간이 아니라 완료시마다 재발사") switched to a chain runner (2 concurrent → wait-for-both → next batch) which completed 76 iters in ~3h wallclock with zero overlap and zero idle gap. Chain is strictly dominant for this class of work.
@effect:
  - Default pacing for batch/iter/queued work is completion-chain. Cron is explicitly narrowed.
  - Eliminates three failure modes simultaneously: overlap, idle-gap, early-fire mid-work.
  - Reduces observability cost (one chained task vs many cron fires in logs).
  - Makes resource usage self-limiting (next spawn waits for prior completion, so host-saturation stays bounded).
@non-goals:
  - Does NOT apply to /loop tick pacing itself (L1/L2/ScheduleWakeup remains for chat-side cadence).
  - Does NOT apply to strictly-periodic heartbeat/watchdog jobs — those should stay on cron since they have no state to chain.
@file: .session_defaults:23 (L8 appended to [LOOP])
@rollback: remove L8. Prior behavior allowed cron+chain indifferently; L8 just makes chain the stated default.

[session-defaults-verify-section]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: .session_defaults :: [VERIFY] V1-V8
@decision: Introduce a completion-evidence regime. Every task must end with a reproducible user-path test, read-back verification of edits, a same-turn commit of any applied edit, and a multi-session-safe commit protocol. Remove hedge-language from completion claims.
@rules:
  - V1 USER_PATH: reproduce exact user-facing invocation, verify exit=0 and expected output observable before declaring done. Build-pass / commit-success are not sufficient.
  - V2 EDGE_PATH: when change has multiple code paths, test at least two (happy/error, mac/remote, fresh/resume, empty/populated).
  - V3 RELOAD_CHECK: for config/hook/prompt/service/env changes, confirm the consumer reloaded (push is not load).
  - V4 CROSS_HOST: if artifact runs on ubu/ubu2/htz/docker, smoke on the destination host, not Mac alone.
  - V5 NO_HEDGE: ban hedging phrases from completion claims; only verified-observation counts; state "테스트 불가 (이유)" explicitly when unverifiable this turn.
  - V6 POST_VERIFY: after Edit/Write, Read the affected section AND grep for added/removed text. Catches edit-drift / line-shift / duplicate insertion.
  - V7 NO_PHANTOM: every applied edit MUST commit in the same turn; uncommitted edits get overwritten or forgotten under multi-session activity.
  - V8 SAFE_COMMIT: multi-session race protocol. Stage only named files (no -A/.); on exit-128 race, accept auto-ship sweep if content present (log the subject mismatch) else re-stage + retry; no --force, no reset --hard, no rebase on pushed commits; verify HEAD matches expected subject after commit.
@why: User corrective 2026-04-20 — two compounding failure modes observed repeatedly in this session and prior ones. (a) "자꾸 됐다고 해서 써보면 안되는 경우가 많아서" — completion claimed from commit/build success without reproducing the user-facing path. (b) "commit 누락 많아서 유령 되버리는 경우도 많아서" — edits marked applied but never committed, overwritten by parallel sessions. Combined with the observed auto-ship Stop hook and parallel cl sessions swallowing commits under mismatched subjects (3 occurrences in this single session: 89530b09 and 93a30928 sweeping DECIDE/F6 edits into docs/claudx-loop subjects), a safe multi-session commit protocol is mandatory.
@effect:
  - Completion reports must carry an observed-result line; hedge language is explicitly banned.
  - Every applied edit lands in the same turn, removing the phantom-edit failure mode.
  - Commits use named-file staging, exit-128 is handled non-destructively, and HEAD verification catches silent auto-ship sweeps.
  - Read-back + grep after edits catches line-shift / duplicate-insert / wrong-path mistakes at the source rather than at user-reproduction.
  - Cross-host and reload-check rules close the macOS-only-passes and push-equals-reload anti-patterns.
@file: .session_defaults:68-76 (VERIFY section appended at end of body)
@rollback: remove [VERIFY] section. V7-V8 are the load-bearing rules — leaving V1-V6 without them preserves the test-before-done discipline but reopens the phantom-edit and race-clobber paths.

[cx-ignore-settings]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: bin/cx :: --ignore-settings flag + CX_IGNORE_SETTINGS=1 env
@decision: cx 레벨에서 hooks / skills / CLAUDE.md / memory 를 한 번에 bypass 하는 단일 opt-in toggle 노출. default 는 기존대로 전부 enabled — 완전 additive (L0 호환).
@why: user 요청 (2026-04-20) — "settings.json(훅,스킬) claude.md 등 작성 ignore 가능?" · 디버깅/깔끔한 샌드박스 세션이 필요할 때 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 을 직접 갈아끼우는 수동 공작 없이 cx 한 플래그로 처리.
@strategy:
  - 빈 settings.json 만 있는 임시 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 로 교체 → hooks/skills/user CLAUDE.md/memory 무력화
  - cwd 를 임시 dir 로 이동 → project CLAUDE.md 도 skip
  - NEXUS_SESSION_LAX=1 자동 주입 → airgenome/bin/claude shim 의 .session_defaults 주입 OFF (진짜 clean)
  - keychain 유지: Mac 은 system keychain → HOME 불변으로 무관. Linux 원격은 $HOME/.claude/.credentials.json 을 tmp dir 에 symlink.
  - claudx rotation 유지: CLAUDX_POOL/USAGE 는 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 와 독립 env → 영향 없음.
  - resume 정확도: 종료 직전 CALLER_CWD 를 원본으로 복원 후 snapshot 저장 → `cx --resume-last` 가 엉뚱한 tmp dir 로 안 감.
@usage:
  - cx --ignore-settings        # one-shot clean 세션
  - CX_IGNORE_SETTINGS=1 cx ... # 셸 전체
  - 세션 env whitelist 에 포함 — resume 시 플래그 자동 복원
@not-supported:
  - --docker (native docker exec, dssh_alias 없는) 모드 — 컨테이너 내부 tmp dir 주입 경로 별도 필요. 현재는 경고 후 skip (ignore_settings=0 으로 downgrade).
  - docker-ssh (dssh_alias) 는 ssh 가 직접 컨테이너로 들어가므로 일반 원격 경로와 동일 — 지원.
@file: bin/cx:32-36 (usage 주석), bin/cx:62 (session env whitelist), bin/cx:460-472 (arg parse), bin/cx:1150-1180 (apply block), bin/cx:1349-1354 (resume snapshot 원본 복원)
@verified:
  - bash -n bin/cx → OK
  - cx --ignore-settings --force-host mac --show → "cx → mac" (arg accepted)
  - CX_IGNORE_SETTINGS=1 cx --force-host mac --show → "cx → mac" (env accepted)
  - 실제 claude 기동 end-to-end 는 TUI interactive → 이 turn 에서 수동 재현 불가 (V5 명시).
@rollback: bin/cx 의 [cx-ignore-settings] 관련 diff 5곳 (usage, whitelist, arg parse, apply block, snapshot 복원) 역적용. 완전 additive — 제거해도 default 경로 무손상.


[tg-bot-edit-in-place]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: bin/tg_bot.hexa :: handle_update freeform 분기, strip_dispatch_noise, +{strip_ansi, send_message_id, edit_message}
@goal:
  (a) `\e]0;airgenome \a` 등 ANSI/OSC escape 가 최종 body 에 섞여 텔레그램에 " ]0;airgenome …" 형태로 노출되는 현상 제거 (user: "여전히 텔레그램 사용에 노이즈").
  (b) "⏳ 디스패치 중…" 을 새 메시지로 이어 보내지 않고 editMessageText 로 in-place 교체 (user: "새메시지가 아니라 · 완료시 자기자신 메시지를 수정").
@attempt-2026-04-20T10:30:
  - strip_ansi() 추가 — write_file → `perl -pe 's/\e\][^\a]*\a//g; s/\e\[[0-9;?]*[a-zA-Z]//g' tmp` 로 OSC/CSI 제거. strip_dispatch_noise 가 선두에서 호출하도록 수정.
  - send_message_id() 추가 — sendMessage 호출을 `curl … | jq -r '.result.message_id // empty'` 로 파이프, int 반환 (0=실패).
  - edit_message() 추가 — editMessageText POST, `--data-urlencode message_id + text@tmp`. `"ok":true` substring 검사.
  - handle_update freeform 분기: send_message_id("⏳ 디스패치 중…") → dispatch → len(body)<=CHUNK_SIZE 면 edit_message, 초과 시 first chunk edit + 나머지 send_chunks, wait_id==0 이면 send_chunks fallback.
@initial-misdiagnosis:
  - 10:36 test "응답 자체가 없음" 을 처음엔 내 edit 의 regression 으로 기록 (state: regression).
  - 실제 원인 확인: **[mac-compute-lockdown] 10:25:03 이 com.airgenome.tg-bot 포함 18개 LaunchAgent 를 Disabled=true + bootout**. `/Users/ghost/.airgenome/mac_allow` SSOT 는 빈 allow list (기본 deny).
  - 증거:
    * `/Users/ghost/Library/LaunchAgents/com.airgenome.tg-bot.plist` → `<Disabled>true</Disabled>` (10:25 이후).
    * `/Users/ghost/.airgenome/tg_bot.log` 마지막 entry 2026-04-20T01:21:01Z ("replied uid=298916303 len=85" — 10:20 test 응답). 이후 heartbeat 전무.
    * `/Users/ghost/.airgenome/tg_leader.lock/heartbeat` mtime 10:22:45 고착 (이후 touch 없음).
    * launchd KeepAlive 는 Disabled 일 때 respawn 하지 않음 → 10:36 test 때는 process 부재.
  - 즉 10:36 silence 는 내 파일 수정과 무관. bot 은 10:22 쯤 이미 lockdown 으로 죽은 뒤였고 내 edit 은 아예 load 조차 되지 않았다.
@verified-2026-04-20T10:49 (lockdown 해제 + bootstrap 후):
  - allow list 사용자 승인 → `~/.airgenome/mac_allow` 에 `com.airgenome.tg-bot` 1줄 append, plist Disabled false 로 수정, Mac 본체에서 `launchctl enable + bootstrap + kickstart` 실행 (이 container 에서 launchctl 미도달).
  - 기동 직후 buffered update (uid=298916304) 자동 처리 → `replied uid=298916304 len=28 edit_id=50` (이전 노이즈 포함 len=85 → 28 로 축소). `edit_id=50` 필드는 이번 패치 추가 로그 → 신규 경로 실행 확인.
  - 사용자 10:49:38 응답 캡처: 단일 버블에 "네, 응답 가능합니다. / 테스트 확인. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?" — `]0;airgenome` 잔존 0 + "⏳ 디스패치 중…" 이 새 메시지로 이어지지 않고 **동일 버블로 edit** 된 것을 육안 확인.
@effect:
  - freeform dispatch 응답이 디스패치-중 말풍선 그대로 덮어쓰여 텔레그램 스크롤 깨끗.
  - claude/claudx 가 tty 오판해 흘리는 OSC/CSI escape 전부 body 진입 전 strip.
  - `edit_id` 로그 필드로 edit 경로 진입 여부 추적 가능 (0 = fallback send_chunks, >0 = edit 성공).
@rollback:
  - 3 블록 역적용: strip_ansi 삭제 + strip_dispatch_noise 에서 cleaned 참조 제거, send_message_id/edit_message 삭제, handle_update 를 `let _ = send_message(⏳) / send_chunks(body)` 원복.
  - 복구 순서는 handle_update 먼저 (호출부 없애야 미정의 함수 참조 안 남음) → 나머지 3 fn 삭제.
@file: bin/tg_bot.hexa:374-407 (send_message_id, edit_message), :436-445 (strip_ansi), :1071-1089 (handle_update freeform)

[mac-death-root-and-safety-net]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: loadgate 부팅 grace · runaway_guard mac_heavy · anima/train_alm_lora guard · oauth-bridge LaunchAgent
@symptom:
  - (1) `cl` 기동 시 `claudx: loadgate=critical — abort` (부팅 직후 uptime 8m/1m load 51)
  - (2) Mac 재사망 연쇄 4회 — 2026-04-20 03:33 kernel panic → 09:47 / 10:13 / 13:01 reset
  - (3) 원격 /login OAuth URL 이 queue 에 append 되어도 Mac 기본 브라우저에서 안 열림
@root:
  - Mac panic 근본: `/private/tmp/train_alm_lora_mac` (anima LoRA 14B training Mac native 바이너리) 이 Ghostty 터미널 parent 로 heavy compute → Compressor 64%/segments 95% + 49 swapfiles + LOW swap → loginwindow watchdog 91s checkin 누락 → kernel panic. 증거 `/Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports/panic-full-2026-04-20-033330.0002.panic` + `~/Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports/train_alm_lora_mac-2026-04-20-09053*.ips` (09:05 3회 crash). **AG6 Mac Compute ZERO 직접 위반**.
  - oauth-bridge 미오픈 근본: `bin/oauth-bridge` 스크립트는 3번 commit (bb9e43ed/8f90c4ce/5db96011) 됐으나 **LaunchAgent 상시 가동 설정이 한 번도 없었음** → queue(~/.airgenome/oauth-queue) 에 URL append 되어도 tail -F 하는 daemon 없어 `open` 호출 안 됨.
  - loadgate critical abort: 부팅 grace 240s(4분) 가 짧아 uptime 8m(480s)/load 51 구간에서 강등 실패. critical 판정(ncpu 8 × 6 = 48) 통과.
@fix:
  1. `shared/claudx/loadgate` — 부팅 transient grace 240s → 600s (commit 9da5e174). critical threshold ncpu×6 은 D1 재증식 보호용으로 유지.
  2. `bin/runaway_guard.hexa` +317/-1 — Darwin 전용 블록, `/private/tmp/train_alm_lora*` prefix + `/private/tmp/*_mac` suffix 패턴 매칭, claude/hexa* 보호 화이트리스트, **dry_run 기본** (log only, `RUNAWAY_MAC_HEAVY_KILL=1` 일 때만 TERM→KILL). self-test 13 mock case 추가 (commit 5108a38a).
  3. `~/Dev/anima/training/train_alm_lora.hexa` — fn main() 첫 줄 Darwin 가드 26줄 (HEXA_LOCAL=1 opt-out, ubu dispatch 가이드). **anima 쪽 미커밋 — 사용자 검토 후 `git add training/train_alm_lora.hexa && git commit` 직접 수행**. 자매 trainer (train_alm_14b*/train_alm_32b_r1/train_clm_gpu) 는 same guard 복붙 follow-up.
  4. `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.airgenome.oauth-bridge.plist` 신규 (KeepAlive=true + RunAtLoad=true + Background + ThrottleInterval 10) + `~/.airgenome/mac_allow` 에 `com.airgenome.oauth-bridge` 추가 (자원 승인제 통과) + `nexus/shared/launchagent.jsonl` SSOT entry (commit f978de8f). daemon pid 9320 live, log "watching ... tunnel=ubu2-d".
@verified:
  - loadgate: `bash shared/claudx/loadgate` → `ok` rc=0 (load 3.83 / critical 48 / grace 600s 적용)
  - runaway_guard: `~/.hx/bin/hexa parse` → `OK: parses cleanly`; self-test 13 mock case 전수 PASS; comm=claude + force=true 조합에서도 kill 호출 없음 확인
  - oauth-bridge: `launchctl list` pid 9320 live; log `watching /Users/ghost/.airgenome/oauth-queue (whitelist=... tunnel=ubu2-d ttl=300s)`; self-test `bash parse / tail / open` 모두 available → PASS
  - anima: 이번 턴 미검증 (hexa run 실 경로 = 사용자 수동)
@followup:
  1. 기존 `/private/tmp/train_alm_lora_mac` 바이너리 (pre-r11 빌드, 가드 없음) 는 사용자가 rebuild 또는 `rm` 해야 최종 안전. Agent A 는 삭제 금지 지시 준수해서 남겨둠.
  2. anima 자매 trainer (train_alm_14b.hexa, train_alm_14b_r5.hexa, train_alm_32b_r1.hexa, train_clm_gpu.hexa) 동일 26줄 guard 복붙 필요. hexa single-file 규약상 common include 금지.
  3. anima `.claude/worktrees/agent-*/training/train_alm_lora.hexa` 7개 pre-r11 구버전 — worktree 병합/삭제 시 자연 해결.
  4. runaway_guard force-kill 경로 (`RUNAWAY_MAC_HEAVY_KILL=1`) 는 사용자 명시 승인 전까지 dry_run 고정.
  5. queue 에 남은 14:31 이전 URL 은 `tail -n0` 특성상 daemon 재시작 후 replay 안 됨. 재시도 필요 시 `bin/oauth-bridge open '<url>'` 수동.
@ref:
  - memory: project_mac_panic_2026_04_20_0333.md · project_ag6-mac-compute-zero.md · feedback_mac_compute_ban.md · feedback_mac_compute_approval_only.md
  - commits: 9da5e174 (loadgate grace) · 5108a38a (runaway_guard mac_heavy) · f978de8f (oauth-bridge SSOT)
  - branch: feat/m11a-cross-host (origin push 완)

[tailscale-extension-runaway-restart]
@state: converged
@date: 2026-04-20
@scope: cl 기동 실패 (loadgate=critical) · Tailscale network-extension runaway · load 171 근본 원인
@symptom:
  - `cl` 진입 시 `claudx: loadgate=critical — abort (CLAUDX_LOADGATE_OFF=1 로 우회)` 반복 발생.
  - 사용자 "core 도 분리했는데" — slice 격리에도 불구하고 loadgate 통과 못함.
  - 실측 load avg = 171.50 (1분) / 73.92 (5분) / 33.45 (15분). ncpu=8, critical 임계=48.
@root:
  - **주 원인**: Tailscale macsys.network-extension (PID 953) 2h24m 동안 124% CPU 지속. systemextension 폭주가 load avg 의 주 기여자.
  - **부 원인**: hexa_stage0 self-rebuild (PID 38263) 97.6% 1분 13초째 동시 진행.
  - **설계적 오해**: slice(cgroups) 는 **Linux 전용**. macOS 에는 미적용 — load avg 는 시스템 전역 지표라 slice 격리와 무관. loadgate 는 `sysctl vm.loadavg` 로 판정하므로 slice 로는 회피 불가.
  - phantom cleanup 미발동: etime≥300s 필터 때문에 73초짜리 stage0 은 보호됨 (정상).
@fix:
  - 코드 수정 없음 (loadgate 600s 부팅 grace + critical threshold 는 직전 converged 블록에서 확정).
  - 운영 조치: `osascript -e 'quit app "Tailscale"'` → 4s wait → `open -a Tailscale`. extension PID 953 → 60228 교체.
@verified:
  - extension CPU: 124.6% → **0.1%** (PID 60228, 15s)
  - load 1분: 171.50 → 12.01 (재시작 전 자연 감소) → **4.66** (재시작 후)
  - `bash shared/claudx/loadgate` → `ok` rc=0 (우회 env 없이 통과)
  - `tailscale status` peer 목록 정상 (aiden-b650m-k active / relay "tok")
  - 활성 inbound Tailscale SSH 1건 (100.72.76.118→Mac:22) 일시 단절 — 재연결 자가 회복.
@followup:
  - Tailscale 1.96.5 extension runaway 가 **재발 주기** 가진다면 launchd watchdog (CPU% > 80 / 30min 초과 시 자동 quit+relaunch) 필요. 현재 1회 관측 — 주기 확인 위해 `ps -Ao pcpu,etime,command | grep tailscale` 일일 스냅샷 고려.
  - macOS 에서 loadgate 는 slice 와 독립된 전역 게이트라는 사실을 memory/feedback 에 명시할지 판단 (사용자 오해 반복 방지).
@ref:
  - memory: feedback_mac_compute_ban.md · project_ag6-mac-compute-zero.md
  - tailscale: /Library/SystemExtensions/B80F575A-A179-432F-8706-BCAC4D45BAAC/io.tailscale.ipn.macsys.network-extension.systemextension
  - loadgate: shared/claudx/loadgate (v M13d, ncpu×6 critical, 600s boot grace)

